WEBVTT

00:23.840 --> 00:28.839
(Based on Softstar Technology
single-player game "Chinese Paladin 3")

00:28.840 --> 00:35.359
(Copyright Notice)

00:35.360 --> 00:36.879
(Viewers under the age of majority
should watch with guardian permission.)

00:36.880 --> 00:38.689
(The content depicted in this film
is fictional.)

00:38.690 --> 00:40.520
(Do not imitate in real life.)

00:58.820 --> 01:01.789
♪Blades of wind cut through dark clouds,
sunset flares to life♪

01:01.790 --> 01:04.060
♪Staining the vast sky red♪

01:04.550 --> 01:09.720
♪A fierce spirit forges a sacred sword,
unafraid of demons♪

01:10.300 --> 01:13.089
♪Breaking the heavens,
shattering the shrouded dark♪

01:13.090 --> 01:15.959
♪Breaking the dream,
thorns blinding the way♪

01:15.960 --> 01:18.379
♪Breaking love,
trapped in hatred and obsession♪

01:18.380 --> 01:21.129
♪The sword's edge ignites
with burning blood♪

01:21.130 --> 01:24.109
♪Fight to the fullest♪

01:24.110 --> 01:26.899
♪Burn to the fullest♪

01:26.900 --> 01:29.689
♪For the one I love♪

01:29.690 --> 01:32.439
♪No regrets whether laughter or tears♪

01:32.440 --> 01:35.239
♪I never stop searching♪

01:35.240 --> 01:38.460
♪I never stop falling♪

01:41.020 --> 01:44.130
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

01:53.760 --> 01:56.799
=Sword and Fairy 3=

01:56.800 --> 01:59.400
=Episode 12=
=Celestial and Demonic Well=

02:04.660 --> 02:05.740
Thank you, Prefect,

02:05.900 --> 02:08.380
for allowing the Shu Mountain Sect
disciples to settle here temporarily.

02:09.420 --> 02:11.100
If not for the Shu Mountain Sect's aid,

02:11.740 --> 02:14.619
Leizhou would likely have long
been reduced to ruin and loss of life.

02:14.620 --> 02:15.659
I shall

02:15.660 --> 02:17.180
thank you.

02:18.060 --> 02:19.340
Prefect, please rise.

02:19.820 --> 02:20.819
It's our duty

02:20.820 --> 02:22.059
to protect the people

02:22.060 --> 02:23.859
and rid the world of demons.

02:23.860 --> 02:24.819
Prefect,

02:24.820 --> 02:26.140
how is Yun Ting?

02:27.120 --> 02:29.730
He is still unconscious.

02:30.030 --> 02:32.700
You saw with your own eyes how
he guarded Leizhou as the Thunder Deity.

02:32.700 --> 02:35.240
He risked his life to retrieve the pearl
and suffered such injuries

02:35.240 --> 02:37.299
to bring true peace to this land.

02:37.300 --> 02:39.260
He is not an ill-omened child.

02:39.700 --> 02:40.900
I know.

02:41.740 --> 02:44.099
Yun Ting has had
a unique constitution since childhood,

02:44.100 --> 02:45.580
prone to attracting lightning strikes.

02:45.780 --> 02:47.860
He would often
injure others unintentionally.

02:48.700 --> 02:52.620
Even his mother
lost her life because of it.

02:53.540 --> 02:57.019
At the time, I did not understand the cause
and feared he might harm someone again.

02:57.020 --> 02:58.059
Even when

02:58.060 --> 03:00.659
he later said
he had learned to control the lightning

03:00.660 --> 03:02.499
and would not endanger lives,

03:02.500 --> 03:04.259
I still refused to yield.

03:04.260 --> 03:05.979
I continued to have him watched,

03:05.980 --> 03:07.579
followed day and night,

03:07.580 --> 03:10.220
insisting he live in seclusion.

03:10.260 --> 03:12.699
Later, I received
guidance from a master.

03:12.700 --> 03:15.019
He said Yun Ting's
lightning power was abundant,

03:15.020 --> 03:17.240
and that he might carry
the Thunder Spirit Pearl within him.

03:17.310 --> 03:19.900
Removing it rashly
could cost him his life.

03:19.940 --> 03:21.459
So I concealed this matter.

03:21.460 --> 03:24.179
(So Father was trying to protect me.)

03:24.180 --> 03:25.789
From the time he understood things,

03:25.790 --> 03:28.400
he has carried deep guilt
over his mother's death.

03:28.460 --> 03:31.739
Even though
I kept my distance because of it,

03:31.740 --> 03:33.620
he never once complained.

03:33.940 --> 03:36.540
He was always
thinking of ways to help others.

03:36.860 --> 03:38.460
I knew all of this.

03:38.820 --> 03:41.100
Yet I kept taking my anger out on him.

03:41.140 --> 03:42.860
I have wronged my child.

03:44.060 --> 03:45.220
Father.

03:46.020 --> 03:46.860
Ting.

03:48.900 --> 03:50.060
Father.

04:00.900 --> 04:02.940
Yun Ting, the Thunder Spirit Pearl...

04:03.300 --> 04:04.979
You have helped me protect Leizhou.

04:04.980 --> 04:07.539
Besides, this power
never truly belonged to me,

04:07.540 --> 04:09.099
and it has drawn demons here.

04:09.100 --> 04:10.579
Now that it has been removed,

04:10.580 --> 04:12.700
it should go
where it rightfully belongs.

04:16.630 --> 04:19.119
Please use it to repair
the Demon-Sealing Pagoda of Shu Mountain

04:19.120 --> 04:20.660
and bring an end to the demon scourge.

04:21.160 --> 04:22.219
That way,

04:22.220 --> 04:24.379
Yun Ting will no longer
fear hurting anyone.

04:24.380 --> 04:25.460
Yes.

04:43.500 --> 04:45.780
Only upon waking from a great dream

04:46.220 --> 04:48.300
does one see how the world has changed.

04:51.100 --> 04:52.540
(Xi Yao)
You have finally come.

04:52.890 --> 04:55.619
Are you speaking to me?

04:55.620 --> 04:56.700
Who are you?

04:57.180 --> 04:59.780
As you are now,
you will not remember me.

05:00.300 --> 05:03.820
I am meeting you in a dream.

05:04.220 --> 05:07.419
You have something important with me.

05:07.420 --> 05:08.820
Something important?

05:08.940 --> 05:11.300
My time is running short.

05:11.540 --> 05:13.100
Please come find me.

05:13.300 --> 05:15.459
Let me return it to its rightful owner.

05:15.460 --> 05:16.900
Where should I go to find you?

05:17.100 --> 05:18.340
Celestial Realm.

05:18.840 --> 05:20.440
Celestial Realm?

05:24.780 --> 05:26.070
A spirit pearl.

05:26.120 --> 05:27.220
Was that a spirit pearl?

05:28.900 --> 05:30.740
Xue... Xuejian.

05:34.300 --> 05:36.459
You... You wait a moment.

05:36.460 --> 05:37.860
Wait, Xuejian.

05:38.980 --> 05:40.339
What foolishness are you up to?

05:40.340 --> 05:42.580
Tian, are you all right?

05:42.900 --> 05:44.620
I'm fine.

05:44.940 --> 05:48.700
(Why did the goddess in my dream
look a bit like Xuejian?)

05:51.040 --> 05:52.870
In the middle of the night,
instead of sleeping,

05:52.910 --> 05:54.620
why are you muttering in your sleep?

05:55.900 --> 05:57.459
Muttering?

05:57.460 --> 06:01.780
You kept talking about
the Celestial Realm and the spirit pearl.

06:02.860 --> 06:04.459
Yes, I just had a dream.

06:04.460 --> 06:07.340
Someone in it told me to go to the
Celestial Realm to get a spirit pearl.

06:07.810 --> 06:08.739
Who was it?

06:08.740 --> 06:10.960
How could a mortal
possibly reach the Celestial Realm?

06:16.780 --> 06:18.580
She has finally found you.

06:19.220 --> 06:20.700
Chong Lou.

06:20.860 --> 06:22.629
You were the one who brought us here?

06:22.630 --> 06:24.380
You said finally.

06:24.500 --> 06:26.419
You know the person from my dream?

06:26.420 --> 06:27.460
I do.

06:27.610 --> 06:30.580
The pearl she spoke of
was yours to begin with.

06:30.740 --> 06:31.940
Mine?

06:32.100 --> 06:35.260
But I have 348 items in my collection.

06:35.380 --> 06:38.060
I know the origin and age of each one.

06:38.240 --> 06:39.970
There is no such pearl among them.

06:41.100 --> 06:44.060
You will learn the reason behind it
in the Celestial Realm.

06:44.800 --> 06:46.460
Then, how do we get there?

06:48.700 --> 06:50.540
I can only lead the way.

06:50.810 --> 06:52.029
Whether you arrive

06:52.030 --> 06:53.830
depends on your own fate.

06:54.230 --> 06:55.710
If you dare, follow me.

07:09.920 --> 07:15.720
(Celestial and Demonic Well)

07:33.140 --> 07:34.259
Chong Lou,

07:34.260 --> 07:35.500
where is this place?

07:36.240 --> 07:37.620
Where are Xuejian and Changqing?

07:38.020 --> 07:40.339
This was built by
the ancestors of the Demon Realm.

07:40.340 --> 07:42.859
It is the only passage connecting
the Celestial and Demon Realms.

07:42.860 --> 07:44.620
The Celestial and Demonic Well.

07:45.310 --> 07:48.759
They are somewhere ahead.
You must find them yourself.

07:48.760 --> 07:51.060
A passage between
the Celestial and Demon Realms?

07:51.940 --> 07:53.420
Do you wish to go to the Demon Realm?

07:53.710 --> 07:55.000
This way.

07:55.040 --> 07:57.509
In that case, the other side
must be the Celestial Realm.

07:57.510 --> 07:58.420
That's right.

07:58.750 --> 08:00.280
Thank you for guiding us.

08:00.540 --> 08:01.979
Since ancient times,

08:01.980 --> 08:05.580
no mortal has ever passed through here
to reach the Celestial Realm.

08:06.130 --> 08:07.060
Why?

08:07.860 --> 08:09.860
That is the Eye of Inner Demons.

08:10.350 --> 08:14.059
The more you fear it,
the more it sees into your heart,

08:14.060 --> 08:16.980
drawing you into an illusion
born of your own inner demons.

08:17.690 --> 08:21.540
Sadly, the human heart
is far too fragile.

08:21.760 --> 08:24.380
Also, the space here is in chaos.

08:24.500 --> 08:27.640
Once someone is lured
and seized by demonic claws,

08:28.900 --> 08:31.220
they will fall forever
into the depths of the well.

08:35.420 --> 08:36.179
Chong Lou,

08:36.180 --> 08:37.899
we may not have known each other long,

08:37.900 --> 08:39.180
but we are still friends.

08:39.260 --> 08:42.500
Is there truly no way for you to take us
straight to the Celestial Realm?

08:43.300 --> 08:45.460
Since when did you become so timid?

08:54.740 --> 08:55.580
Xuejian.

08:56.180 --> 08:56.980
Watch out!

09:12.820 --> 09:13.940
Boss Jing,

09:13.980 --> 09:16.299
these are a few new items
taken in at the pawnshop.

09:16.300 --> 09:17.660
Please have a look.

09:17.940 --> 09:19.060
You...

09:19.460 --> 09:20.780
You called me boss?

09:21.130 --> 09:22.170
Zhao Wenchang,

09:22.640 --> 09:25.500
where did you put my grandfather's
Haitanghong Zisha Pot?

09:25.630 --> 09:27.779
The lady boss is here.

09:27.780 --> 09:29.860
I'll fetch it for you at once.

09:30.060 --> 09:31.220
Lady boss?

09:34.500 --> 09:38.150
You spend every day
playing with shards of porcelain.

09:38.380 --> 09:41.380
Tell me, do you remember what today is?

09:41.620 --> 09:43.180
What day?

09:43.460 --> 09:45.300
On this day three years ago,

09:45.380 --> 09:47.740
you fixed my grandfather's teapot lid.

09:48.300 --> 09:49.960
Three years ago?

09:50.260 --> 09:53.300
Has it really already been three years?

09:57.760 --> 09:58.860
Xuejian.

09:59.510 --> 10:00.330
I...

10:00.830 --> 10:01.459
Brother.

10:01.460 --> 10:02.660
Sister-in-law.

10:04.820 --> 10:07.899
Sister-in-law,
when will I get to be an aunt?

10:07.900 --> 10:08.859
Oh my,

10:08.860 --> 10:11.460
Kui, you are so mischievous.

10:12.740 --> 10:14.819
Kui has become human too.

10:14.820 --> 10:15.700
I...

10:16.060 --> 10:17.660
This must be a dream.

10:18.900 --> 10:20.590
An earthquake. Watch out!

10:21.700 --> 10:23.140
My Qingyu Guanyin.

10:32.520 --> 10:33.339
Ah!

10:33.340 --> 10:33.979
Sister-in-law.

10:33.980 --> 10:34.940
Xuejian.

10:41.220 --> 10:42.260
Just now...

10:43.020 --> 10:44.900
Was that my illusion?

10:45.380 --> 10:46.500
Brother,

10:46.810 --> 10:48.380
that was the inner demon illusion.

10:48.650 --> 10:50.690
The inner demon illusion?

10:51.460 --> 10:52.380
This is bad.

11:00.580 --> 11:02.579
Xuejian, wake up.

11:02.580 --> 11:04.100
It's dangerous ahead.

11:18.140 --> 11:19.450
Xuejian!

11:23.730 --> 11:24.700
Grandfather.

11:25.500 --> 11:27.940
Tang Family Fort is no longer my home.

11:28.500 --> 11:32.770
And now even Jing Tian
is going to abandon me.

11:33.220 --> 11:36.500
Do you really think you are still
the young lady of the Tang family?

11:36.860 --> 11:40.700
I followed you before
just to make some money.

11:40.980 --> 11:42.059
You know that.

11:42.060 --> 11:43.540
That is the kind of person I am.

11:43.900 --> 11:46.860
Besides, I have now received
the true teachings of Shu Mountain Sect.

11:47.180 --> 11:50.700
I truly do not understand
why you still trail after me.

11:56.380 --> 11:57.820
If I am a burden,

11:58.220 --> 11:59.860
then let us part ways!

12:00.620 --> 12:01.460
Xuejian!

12:10.300 --> 12:11.860
Xuejian!

12:24.440 --> 12:27.889
♪War flames rise,
the mountains and rivers tremble♪

12:27.890 --> 12:31.129
♪Reincarnation begins,
cause and effect fall into chaos♪

12:31.130 --> 12:34.789
♪The night grows thick, dark as ink♪

12:34.790 --> 12:38.069
♪The wheel of fate starts
to turn backward♪

12:38.070 --> 12:41.109
♪Crimson palace walls,
stained with blood and tears♪

12:41.110 --> 12:43.469
♪Vows scatter with the wind,
fading into the clouds♪

12:43.470 --> 12:44.550
Xuejian.

12:45.460 --> 12:46.819
No matter what you see,

12:46.820 --> 12:48.139
it is all false.

12:48.140 --> 12:50.780
These demon eyes
can make people see illusions.

12:51.020 --> 12:52.380
It is not real.

12:52.980 --> 12:54.140
Then, what about you?

12:54.580 --> 12:55.700
I am real.

12:56.100 --> 12:58.339
Xuejian, listen to me.

12:58.340 --> 12:59.619
If I had never met you,

12:59.620 --> 13:01.980
I would not be who I am today.

13:02.220 --> 13:03.939
You are like family to me,

13:03.940 --> 13:05.299
not a burden.

13:05.300 --> 13:06.219
I...

13:06.220 --> 13:08.700
I will always stay by your side.

13:09.020 --> 13:10.500
Jing Tian.

13:13.020 --> 13:14.380
Zi Xuan!

13:16.060 --> 13:17.460
To slay demons and rid evil,

13:17.540 --> 13:20.060
the Demon-Sealing Pagoda must be sealed.

13:20.100 --> 13:21.940
I have no other choice.

13:22.180 --> 13:23.619
Forgive me, Zi Xuan.

13:23.620 --> 13:26.380
We will meet again in the next life.

13:29.460 --> 13:30.540
Changqing.

13:52.820 --> 13:56.819
I must shoulder my responsibility.

13:56.820 --> 13:57.740
Changqing,

13:57.840 --> 13:59.780
this is all an illusion.
Do not believe it.

13:59.860 --> 14:01.300
What responsibility?

14:01.660 --> 14:04.860
It is nothing
but the foolish arrogance of mortals.

14:06.860 --> 14:09.780
I am willing to fight
for all living beings under heaven.

14:10.780 --> 14:12.420
But Zi Xuan is dead.

14:12.780 --> 14:14.500
How could I live on alone?

14:15.140 --> 14:16.660
Zi Xuan is dead.

14:16.780 --> 14:18.179
How could I live on alone?

14:18.180 --> 14:19.140
Changqing,

14:19.220 --> 14:20.899
even if we truly reach the brink,

14:20.900 --> 14:22.339
we will stand by your side

14:22.340 --> 14:23.620
and face it with you.

14:23.980 --> 14:24.860
Changqing,

14:25.060 --> 14:28.260
Zi Xuan is waiting
for you at Shu Mountain.

14:28.580 --> 14:29.700
Zi Xuan.

14:30.140 --> 14:31.540
She is waiting for me?

14:33.220 --> 14:35.860
Tian, Xuejian.

14:37.500 --> 14:39.420
Was that illusion your doing?

14:40.340 --> 14:41.820
Ignorant mortals.

14:41.900 --> 14:43.379
As the saying goes, you dream about

14:43.380 --> 14:44.739
what's on your mind.

14:44.740 --> 14:46.740
The illusion you just experienced

14:46.820 --> 14:48.540
came from your own inner demons.

14:48.900 --> 14:49.859
But

14:49.860 --> 14:51.860
you, these people from the Shu Mountain,

14:52.220 --> 14:54.339
believe you can save all living beings.

14:54.340 --> 14:56.940
Yet the fate of the world
has its own course.

14:57.100 --> 15:00.100
Shu Mountain takes protecting
the mortal realm as its duty.

15:00.110 --> 15:02.019
We naturally must
slay demons for the sake of all.

15:02.020 --> 15:04.140
You cannot even manage your own life

15:04.260 --> 15:07.140
and have brought suffering
upon those closest to you.

15:07.180 --> 15:08.540
Impressive indeed.

15:09.740 --> 15:11.140
Among the Six Realms,

15:11.260 --> 15:15.260
only humans were granted
emotions and desires by Nuwa.

15:15.500 --> 15:18.219
Only humans are bound by destiny

15:18.220 --> 15:19.779
and joined as husband and wife.

15:19.780 --> 15:21.979
Yet some do not know
how to cherish this.

15:21.980 --> 15:23.139
As mortals,

15:23.140 --> 15:25.340
they would rather
neglect the one beside them

15:25.380 --> 15:27.700
than stop speaking
of grand duties to the world.

15:27.900 --> 15:29.100
How laughable.

15:29.260 --> 15:30.180
Chong Lou,

15:30.460 --> 15:31.980
you have helped me many times.

15:32.140 --> 15:33.460
I consider you a friend.

15:33.580 --> 15:35.460
But you cannot
speak of Changqing this way.

15:35.620 --> 15:37.780
He is deeply devoted to Zi Xuan.

15:37.860 --> 15:39.660
He would never betray her.

15:39.740 --> 15:41.220
Even if he did not betray her,

15:41.420 --> 15:44.420
I fear he has not
truly cherished her either.

15:45.020 --> 15:46.860
Changqing,
do not listen to his nonsense.

15:46.980 --> 15:48.379
Do what you believe is right

15:48.380 --> 15:49.740
as long as your conscience is clear.

15:50.420 --> 15:51.460
Tian.

15:55.740 --> 15:57.220
There is no need
to argue with this demon.

15:57.300 --> 16:01.060
He may seem to be guiding you with the sword,
but he could have other intentions.

16:01.340 --> 16:03.939
Now, he mocks Changqing.

16:03.940 --> 16:05.940
I fear he harbors ulterior motives

16:05.980 --> 16:07.339
toward Zi Xuan as well.

16:07.340 --> 16:09.940
Mind your words, little one.

16:10.060 --> 16:12.339
I merely feel
it is unjust for her descendants.

16:12.340 --> 16:13.700
Her descendants?

16:17.300 --> 16:18.590
What was that sound?

16:23.580 --> 16:25.300
Chong Lou, watch out!

16:25.500 --> 16:27.580
You have overcome
the inner demon illusion.

16:27.660 --> 16:29.699
Defeat these Demon Bones as well,

16:29.700 --> 16:32.300
and you may reach
the threshold of the Celestial Realm.

16:32.980 --> 16:34.660
Take care.

16:35.940 --> 16:38.980
That red-haired one runs quite fast.

16:39.420 --> 16:41.540
What kind of monster is this?

16:51.340 --> 16:52.300
Strange.

16:52.580 --> 16:54.020
Why did it have no effect?

16:59.340 --> 17:02.420
These bones are the remains
of ancient demonic beasts.

17:02.540 --> 17:03.860
They possess immense demonic power.

17:20.700 --> 17:21.820
What is happening?

17:22.060 --> 17:23.860
These Demon Bones
are protected by a barrier.

17:23.940 --> 17:25.340
Immortal arts cannot break it.

17:27.660 --> 17:28.740
Watch the ground.

17:32.220 --> 17:33.100
Jing Tian!

17:34.300 --> 17:35.310
I'm fine.

18:07.100 --> 18:08.420
Darn it.

18:16.780 --> 18:19.060
You will not deceive anyone again.

18:25.820 --> 18:27.219
This cannot go on.

18:27.220 --> 18:29.660
We can work together
to send Demon Bones over the cliff.

18:29.660 --> 18:30.899
Cover me while I return to the ground.

18:30.900 --> 18:31.699
I will clear the way.

18:31.700 --> 18:33.299
Jing Tian, seize the moment.

18:33.300 --> 18:34.150
All right.

18:44.840 --> 18:47.400
(Demonic Flame Sky-Cleaving Slash)

19:10.200 --> 19:12.000
(Void Rend Earth Devour)

19:35.730 --> 19:38.700
That must be the entrance
to the Celestial Realm.

19:43.050 --> 19:44.329
Unite sword and qi,

19:44.330 --> 19:45.810
ride the sword and soar.

19:46.050 --> 19:46.970
Rise!

19:48.490 --> 19:49.730
It worked!

19:50.730 --> 19:51.890
Jingjing.

20:13.090 --> 20:16.369
♪War flames rise,
the mountains and rivers tremble♪

20:16.370 --> 20:19.689
♪Reincarnation begins,
cause and effect fall into chaos♪

20:19.690 --> 20:23.369
♪The night grows thick, dark as ink♪

20:23.370 --> 20:26.569
♪The wheel of fate starts
to turn backward♪

20:26.570 --> 20:29.729
♪Crimson palace walls,
stained with blood and tears♪

20:29.730 --> 20:33.409
♪Vows scatter with the wind,
fading into the clouds♪

20:33.410 --> 20:37.129
♪Moonlight cannot pierce this darkness♪

20:37.130 --> 20:43.609
♪Who cries out in loneliness
from the abyss♪

20:43.610 --> 20:47.089
♪The net of destiny tightens ever more♪

20:47.090 --> 20:50.569
♪The lock of karma
binds a lifetime unbroken♪

20:50.570 --> 20:53.969
♪Love and hate entwined beyond escape♪

20:53.970 --> 20:57.369
♪Not awaken in a world of chaos♪

20:57.370 --> 21:00.729
♪Stars shatter, heaven and earth mourn♪

21:00.730 --> 21:04.249
♪Snow fills Shu Mountain,
only ruins remain♪

21:04.250 --> 21:07.609
♪Five elements in balance,
six realms side by side♪

21:07.610 --> 21:10.929
♪All for the sake of the living♪

21:10.930 --> 21:15.730
♪Stepping onto a path of no return♪

21:30.760 --> 21:34.299
(Next episode preview)

21:34.300 --> 21:35.499
This tree

21:35.500 --> 21:37.060
is enormous.

21:38.620 --> 21:41.180
It is just like the one
I saw in my dream.

21:41.900 --> 21:43.500
You have finally come.

21:44.180 --> 21:45.300
Great.

21:45.860 --> 21:47.940
I can see you one last time.

21:50.700 --> 21:52.700
Those who trespass
into the Celestial Realm

21:52.780 --> 21:54.660
shall be executed without mercy!
